# 🔍 Dry Run Example

### Example: `n = 5`

### DP Table Build:

| i | Possible Moves | dp[i] |
| - | -------------- | ----- |
| 1 | ❌              | false |
| 2 | 2 → 1          | true  |
| 3 | 3 → 2          | false |
| 4 | 4 → 1,2        | true  |
| 5 | 5 → 4          | false |

👉 Final Answer: `false`

